---
---
<section id="nosotros" class="py-24 bg-secondary relative overflow-hidden px-6">
  
  <!-- Subtle top visual separation shape -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-12 bg-primary shape-slant-l opacity-20"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-center">
    
    <!-- Left Column: Visual Structure / Multi-layered Geometric Blocks -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6 order-2 lg:order-1">
      <div class="relative w-full aspect-[4/5] max-w-[380px] mx-auto lg:mx-0">
        <!-- Golden back borders -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 border-2 border-accent/25 rounded-sm translate-x-4 translate-y-4"></div>
        
        <!-- Premium Stately Container acting as an executive portrait showcase -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-primary rounded-sm border border-slate-800 p-8 flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden shadow-2xl group hover:border-accent/40 transition-colors duration-300">
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <span class="font-serif text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-accent font-semibold">Nuestra Sede Central</span>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-xl font-bold text-slate-100">Presencia Ejecutiva</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Ubicados en el distrito financiero corporativo, diseñamos un espacio donde la discreción, la solemnidad y el rigor ético se conjugan para brindar un servicio de excelencia absoluta.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Pillars of Aurelius drawing vector -->
          <div class="relative h-28 border-t border-slate-800/80 pt-4 flex items-end justify-around">
            <div class="w-2.5 bg-accent/20 h-24 rounded-t-sm transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-20 group-hover:bg-accent/40"></div>
            <div class="w-2.5 bg-accent/25 h-16 rounded-t-sm transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-24 group-hover:bg-accent/40"></div>
            <div class="w-2.5 bg-accent/20 h-20 rounded-t-sm transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-16 group-hover:bg-accent/40"></div>
            <div class="w-2.5 bg-accent/15 h-24 rounded-t-sm transition-all duration-500 group-hover:h-22 group-hover:bg-accent/40"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- Right Column: Firm introduction and core differentials -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6 order-1 lg:order-2">
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <span class="font-sans text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase font-semibold text-accent block">Sobre Nosotros</span>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-100 tracking-wide leading-tight">
          Un Legado De <span class="text-accent">Excelencia & Liderazgo</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-accent mt-2"></div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        Fundada bajo los principios de rigor analítico, confidencialidad absoluta y lealtad inquebrantable, nuestra firma se ha consolidado como el aliado de confianza para resolver controversias legales de alta complejidad.
      </p>
      
      <p class="font-sans text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-light">
        No nos limitamos a interpretar la ley; la analizamos desde múltiples perspectivas corporativas para adelantarnos a los escenarios adversos. Creemos que la mejor victoria es aquella que se asegura antes de entrar al tribunal mediante un diseño contractual impecable.
      </p>
      
      <!-- Core Values Checklist -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-4">
        <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Rigurosidad Técnica</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Análisis profundo y sin fisuras de cada caso.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Confidencialidad Absoluta</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Secreto profesional blindado institucionalmente.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Enfoque Proactivo</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Anticipación inteligente ante contingencias futuras.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-serif text-sm font-bold text-slate-100 uppercase tracking-wider">Trato Premium</h4>
            <p class="font-sans text-xs text-slate-400 mt-1">Comunicación transparente y canal ejecutivo ágil.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>
